Cell["\<\
The cube, a square torus and the smallest map of heptagons, three at every \
vertex: Euler characteristic 2, 0 and \[Minus]4.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"f598bc6e-ae76-4ca8-9933-90def94c8b18"],

